#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:1 de6639b9c2034047b5f88c3a43ecc970
msgid "评测协议与指标"
msgstr "Evaluation Protocol and Metrics"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:3 5c9bcddb5ac34111a79249db9ea10ccc
msgid ""
"为了降低单次随机划分带来的方差与偏差，提供可复现的基准评估结果，UniKT 采用固定留出测试集结合训练池 5 折交叉验证，并汇报 5 "
"折均值与标准差。具体模型成绩可查阅[排行榜](leaderboard.md)。"
msgstr ""
"To reduce single-split variance and provide reproducible benchmark "
"results, UniKT pairs a fixed hold-out test set with 5-fold cross-"
"validation on the training pool and reports the 5-fold mean and standard "
"deviation. Benchmark scores are available on the "
"[Leaderboard](leaderboard.md)."

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:5 beefe0d2058647348308b74256aad7a0
msgid "标准 5 折交叉验证"
msgstr "Standard 5-Fold Cross-Validation"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:7 480fe6e61a2a4a6d90c737d78bce3cdc
msgid "学生级无泄露切分协议"
msgstr "Leak-Free Student-Level Splitting Protocol"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:9 f3877455e0d54b7fb4db7ed8bd22283a
msgid "在知识追踪任务中，若直接对全部答题记录随机打乱切分，同一学生不同时段的记录会同时落入训练集与测试集，导致评估虚高。"
msgstr ""
"In knowledge tracing, shuffling individual interaction logs leaks "
"information across splits when records from the same student appear in "
"both training and test sets, artificially inflating performance."

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:11 3128a6ceb0ea4d7faf5745e24f214950
msgid ""
"UniKT 在固定随机种子下按学生随机切分（长序列切分均在划分后执行）：先按学生人数近似留出 **20%** 作为固定测试集（`fold = "
"-1`），再将剩余 **80%** 学生均匀划分为 5 折（`fold = 0..4`）。"
msgstr ""
"Under a fixed random seed, UniKT randomly partitions students (with long-"
"sequence chunking performed afterward): approximately **20%** by student "
"count are held out as a fixed test set (`fold = -1`), and the remaining "
"**80%** are divided evenly into 5 folds (`fold = 0..4`)."

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:20 1da85bc229644cc58dc308ad71d55526
msgid "**训练集 64%**"
msgstr "**Train 64%**"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:22 572cc6d17d584e72839c7d22ce3d0435
msgid "训练池其余 4 折"
msgstr "Remaining 4 pool folds"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:26 abf7b476417b4bb4a0352380cf1c08b3
msgid "**验证集 16%**"
msgstr "**Val 16%**"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:28 0a385311e0094dcda577ceeadba61603
msgid "训练池第 k 折"
msgstr "Pool fold k"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:32 89c0c172f40a4bd782d9f31cd1917ed2
msgid "**固定测试集 20%**"
msgstr "**Fixed Test 20%**"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:34 1e4edff64e2e488b838768272875fd07
msgid "fold = -1"
msgstr "fold = -1"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:39 399e0e92f2144606ac1a9b89c8286fc1
msgid ""
"默认划分为 `--data.fold 0`：第 0 折学生序列作验证集（16%，早停监控），训练池其余 4 折作训练集（64%），另留出 20% "
"学生作固定测试集（`fold = -1`）用于最终评估。"
msgstr ""
"The default split is `--data.fold 0`: fold 0 student sequences form the "
"validation set (16%, early-stopping monitor), the other 4 training-pool "
"folds form the training set (64%), and 20% of students are held out as a "
"fixed test set (`fold = -1`) for final evaluation."

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:41 0f03577672d44981b6be33a00dff3142
msgid ""
"5 折基准评估依次指定 `--data.fold 0` 至 `--data.fold 4`。验证折随参数切换，训练集自动取其余 4 "
"折，固定测试集在所有折上保持一致。"
msgstr ""
"5-fold benchmark evaluation runs `--data.fold 0` through `--data.fold 4` "
"in turn. The validation fold follows the parameter, the training set "
"automatically takes the other 4 folds, and the fixed test set stays the "
"same across all folds."

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:43 c0c7cd4c20854f239ae7bbdce00e2824
msgid "学生级子采样与数据集设置"
msgstr "Student-level Subsampling and Dataset Settings"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:45 a84c69615ceb4cfaac61531b2d0329f6
msgid "11 个数据集在统一预处理后的全量保留学生上评测。"
msgstr ""
"11 datasets are evaluated on all students retained by the unified "
"preprocessing pipeline."

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:46 7e08911679b7487cb1f413b59292bd08
msgid ""
"`EdNet-KT1`（5,000 名）、`Junyi2015`（5,000 名）、`XES3G5M`（2,500 "
"名）在切分前执行学生级随机子采样，复现时在 `data_process.py process` 阶段指定 "
"`--data.sample_size`。"
msgstr ""
"`EdNet-KT1` (5,000 students), `Junyi2015` (5,000) and `XES3G5M` (2,500) "
"are randomly subsampled at the student level before splitting; pass "
"`--data.sample_size` to `data_process.py process` to reproduce."

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:47 c41bf4928d6645b4bdafd24be1ba721d
msgid ""
"`ASSISTments 2017` 提供两种预处理设置：题目级重构 `ASSISTments17-PQ` 与原始步级记录 "
"`ASSISTments17`。"
msgstr ""
"`ASSISTments 2017` ships with two preprocessing settings: question-level "
"reconstruction (`ASSISTments17-PQ`) and the original step-level records "
"(`ASSISTments17`)."

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:48 6f1353a9b7ce45468d178da55824db48
msgid "`ABKT` 需模型专用协议，榜单单独标注，不纳入共享协议直接排名。"
msgstr ""
"`ABKT` requires a model-specific protocol; it is labelled separately on "
"the leaderboard and excluded from the shared-protocol ranking."

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:50 f51488dfdf9e4c9f918ac17a8a5a78db
msgid "使用辅助脚本 `run_kfold.sh`"
msgstr "Using Helper Script `run_kfold.sh`"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:52 8340a1facc5141f7893167db5e68fa3a
msgid "UniKT 在 `scripts/run_kfold.sh` 中提供了多折连续执行脚本，支持训练参数透传与多折自动化串联。"
msgstr ""
"UniKT provides `scripts/run_kfold.sh` for consecutive multi-fold "
"execution, supporting argument forwarding and automated multi-fold "
"chaining."

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:54 0a85d6adc0f645ba9d21019a6ec04caa
msgid "A. 查看所有支持的模型列表"
msgstr "A. List All Supported Models"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:56 aa6fb9c8e92a4b4aa865abeaf3d532d3
msgid "使用 `-l` 或 `--list` 选项列出当前代码库中所有已支持的模型："
msgstr "Use `-l` or `--list` to list all supported models in the current codebase:"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:58 8a6273f189c144a0ba644e42400a9746
msgid "bash scripts/run_kfold.sh -l\n"
msgstr "bash scripts/run_kfold.sh -l\n"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:62 28d52d092cb64284a4869cf722b71a93
msgid "B. 运行单模型的 5 折交叉验证"
msgstr "B. Run 5-Fold Cross-Validation for a Single Model"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:64 8de794b5531649b7b853b547a815f6f2
msgid "向脚本传入模型名称、折索引列表及待透传的训练参数："
msgstr ""
"Pass the model name, fold index list, and training hyperparameters to the"
" script:"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:66 148324d0ec974459b2470c242eba25ab
msgid ""
"bash scripts/run_kfold.sh GIKT \"0 1 2 3 4\" -d assistments09 "
"--model.epochs 150 --model.batch_size 128\n"
msgstr ""
"bash scripts/run_kfold.sh GIKT \"0 1 2 3 4\" -d assistments09 "
"--model.epochs 150 --model.batch_size 128\n"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:70 b2c7aeede79d4d2eb110e91ee2afa3ae
msgid ""
"支持空格分隔（`\"0 1 2 3 4\"`）或逗号分隔（`\"0,1,2,3,4\"`）。脚本将依次启动第 0 至第 4 "
"折的训练任务。"
msgstr ""
"Supports space-separated (`\"0 1 2 3 4\"`) or comma-separated "
"(`\"0,1,2,3,4\"`) strings. The script launches fold 0 through fold 4 "
"sequentially."

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:72 01df7e882d2740e5961fd6bce16a919c
msgid "C. 运行特定子集折"
msgstr "C. Run a Subset of Folds"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:74 0ebaba5e22c94837b2d08f3e91f19f10
msgid "若某次训练在某几折中断，或只需在特定折验证："
msgstr ""
"If training was interrupted on specific folds, or if only a subset "
"requires validation:"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:76 a03a4d1763f2426cab3362e751e6f5a4
msgid ""
"# 仅执行第 0 折和第 2 折\n"
"bash scripts/run_kfold.sh GIKT \"0 2\" -d assistments09 --model.epochs "
"100\n"
msgstr ""
"# Execute only fold 0 and fold 2\n"
"bash scripts/run_kfold.sh GIKT \"0 2\" -d assistments09 --model.epochs "
"100\n"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:81 92e6241589244362aa7d2b4d079117a4
msgid "D. 原生命令行手动执行"
msgstr "D. Manual Invocation via Native CLI"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:83 42d26b24e7f1444e8822d7a6901ba01a
msgid "如果不使用 bash 脚本，也可以直接在终端通过原生循环调用 `train.py`："
msgstr ""
"Without the bash helper, you can directly run a native loop calling "
"`train.py` in the terminal:"

#: ../../source/evaluation/protocol.md:85 42ea60c4ddb8452eb656bfb329034b22
msgid ""
"for fold in 0 1 2 3 4; do\n"
"  python train.py -m GIKT -d assistments09 --data.fold $fold "
"--model.epochs 150 --model.batch_size 128\n"
"done\n"
msgstr ""
"for fold in 0 1 2 3 4; do\n"
"  python train.py -m GIKT -d assistments09 --data.fold $fold "
"--model.epochs 150 --model.batch_size 128\n"
"done\n"
